---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ThemeToggle from "../components/ThemeToggle.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Hire Akshit | AI Agents, Evals & Product Engineering"
  description="Work with Akshit Kr Nagpal on AI agents, evaluation systems, developer tools, and production product engineering."
>
  <main class="hire-page min-h-dvh relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.012] pointer-events-none" style="background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=%270 0 256 256%27 xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%3E%3Cfilter id=%27noise%27%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%27fractalNoise%27 baseFrequency=%270.8%27 numOctaves=%274%27 stitchTiles=%27stitch%27/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%27100%25%27 height=%27100%25%27 filter=%27url(%23noise)%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E');"></div>
    <div class="hire-glow absolute top-[-15rem] right-[-12rem] w-[44rem] h-[44rem] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 min-h-dvh flex flex-col">
      <nav class="w-full px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-14 py-5 flex justify-between items-center animate-fade-in">
        <a href="/" class="text-sm tracking-wide font-medium transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-70 flex items-center gap-2" style="color: var(--color-ink);">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path>
          </svg>
          Back home
        </a>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <span class="hidden sm:inline text-xs tracking-[0.18em] uppercase font-medium" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Work together</span>
          <ThemeToggle />
        </div>
      </nav>

      <div class="flex-1 px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-14 pt-6 md:pt-12 pb-16 md:pb-20">
        <div class="max-w-[76rem] mx-auto">
          <header class="max-w-4xl mb-10 md:mb-16 animate-fade-up">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
              <span class="availability-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase font-medium" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Available for select projects</p>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.6rem] leading-[0.94] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-6" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">
              Build AI systems that<br class="hidden sm:block" /> <em class="font-normal" style="color: var(--color-accent);">hold up in production.</em>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl" style="color: var(--color-muted);">
              I work with teams on AI agents, evaluation systems, and the product engineering around them, from architecture to a production-ready release.
            </p>
          </header>

          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.72fr)_minmax(30rem,1fr)] gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start">
            <section class="animate-fade-up delay-1" aria-labelledby="good-fit-heading">
              <p id="good-fit-heading" class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase font-medium mb-5" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Where I can help</p>
              <div class="border-t" style="border-color: var(--color-border);">
                <article class="service-row">
                  <span>01</span>
                  <div>
                    <h2>AI agents &amp; evals</h2>
                    <p>Agent workflows, regression testing, MCP integrations, and the production systems that make them reliable.</p>
                  </div>
                </article>
                <article class="service-row">
                  <span>02</span>
                  <div>
                    <h2>Product engineering</h2>
                    <p>Focused full-stack products with clear UX, strong foundations, and a practical path to production.</p>
                  </div>
                </article>
                <article class="service-row">
                  <span>03</span>
                  <div>
                    <h2>Technical direction</h2>
                    <p>Architecture, evaluation strategy, and product decisions before your team commits to a build.</p>
                  </div>
                </article>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-8 md:mt-10 p-5 border" style="border-color: var(--color-border); background: var(--color-surface);">
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3" style="color: var(--color-muted);">Prefer a plain email?</p>
                <a class="email-link" href="mailto:hello@akshit.io">
                  hello@akshit.io
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"></path>
                  </svg>
                </a>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="form-card animate-fade-up delay-2" aria-labelledby="inquiry-heading">
              <div class="mb-7">
                <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.24em] uppercase font-medium mb-2" style="color: var(--color-accent);">Project brief</p>
                <h2 id="inquiry-heading" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-none mb-3" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">Tell me what you’re building</h2>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-muted);">A few useful details are enough. This form creates a ready-to-send email in your mail app.</p>
              </div>

              <form id="hire-form" action="mailto:hello@akshit.io" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
                <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Name</span>
                    <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Email</span>
                    <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com" required />
                  </label>
                </div>

                <label class="field mt-5">
                  <span>Company <small>Optional</small></span>
                  <input type="text" name="company" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Company or product" />
                </label>

                <fieldset class="mt-6">
                  <legend>What do you need?</legend>
                  <div class="choice-grid">
                    <label class="choice">
                      <input type="radio" name="projectType" value="Build a product" required />
                      <span>Build a product</span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="choice">
                      <input type="radio" name="projectType" value="Improve a product" />
                      <span>Improve a product</span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="choice">
                      <input type="radio" name="projectType" value="Technical direction" />
                      <span>Technical direction</span>
                    </label>
                    <label class="choice">
                      <input type="radio" name="projectType" value="Something else" />
                      <span>Something else</span>
                    </label>
                  </div>
                </fieldset>

                <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-5">
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Timeline</span>
                    <select name="timeline" required>
                      <option value="" disabled selected>Select a timeline</option>
                      <option>As soon as possible</option>
                      <option>Within 1 month</option>
                      <option>1–3 months</option>
                      <option>Still exploring</option>
                    </select>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span>Budget <small>USD</small></span>
                    <select name="budget" required>
                      <option value="" disabled selected>Select a range</option>
                      <option>Under $5k</option>
                      <option>$5k–$15k</option>
                      <option>$15k–$30k</option>
                      <option>$30k+</option>
                      <option>Not sure yet</option>
                    </select>
                  </label>
                </div>

                <label class="field mt-5">
                  <span>Tell me about the project</span>
                  <textarea name="message" rows="5" placeholder="What are you building, who is it for, and where are you stuck?" required></textarea>
                </label>

                <button class="submit-button" type="submit">
                  Create email draft
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"></path>
                  </svg>
                </button>
                <p id="form-status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
              </form>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[var(--color-accent)] to-transparent"></div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script>
    const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>("#hire-form");
    const status = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#form-status");

    form?.addEventListener("submit", (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();

      if (!form.reportValidity()) return;

      const data = new FormData(form);
      const name = String(data.get("name") || "").trim();
      const email = String(data.get("email") || "").trim();
      const company = String(data.get("company") || "").trim();
      const projectType = String(data.get("projectType") || "").trim();
      const timeline = String(data.get("timeline") || "").trim();
      const budget = String(data.get("budget") || "").trim();
      const message = String(data.get("message") || "").trim();

      const subject = `Project inquiry from ${name}${company ? ` at ${company}` : ""}`;
      const body = [
        `Hi Akshit,`,
        "",
        message,
        "",
        "Project details",
        `Type: ${projectType}`,
        `Timeline: ${timeline}`,
        `Budget: ${budget}`,
        `Name: ${name}`,
        `Email: ${email}`,
        company ? `Company: ${company}` : null,
      ].filter(Boolean).join("\n");

      if (status) status.textContent = "Opening your email app…";
      window.location.href = `mailto:hello@akshit.io?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(body)}`;
    });
  </script>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hire-glow {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 16%, transparent) 0%, transparent 68%);
    filter: blur(28px);
  }

  .availability-dot {
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #22c55e;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px color-mix(in srgb, #22c55e 15%, transparent);
  }

  .service-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.35rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .service-row > span {
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .service-row h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .service-row p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .email-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 180ms ease;
  }

  .email-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .form-card {
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-surface) 88%, transparent);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  }

  .field {
    display: block;
  }

  .field > span,
  fieldset legend {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .field small {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .field input,
  .field select,
  .field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 0;
    outline: none;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    transition: border-color 180ms ease, background-color 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease;
  }

  .field input,
  .field select {
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding: 0 0.9rem;
  }

  .field textarea {
    min-height: 8rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .field input::placeholder,
  .field textarea::placeholder {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    opacity: 0.68;
  }

  .field input:focus,
  .field select:focus,
  .field textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-surface-hover);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 12%, transparent);
  }

  .choice-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .choice {
    position: relative;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .choice input {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .choice span {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color 180ms ease, background-color 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;
  }

  .choice:hover span {
    border-color: var(--color-border-strong);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .choice input:checked + span {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 9%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .choice input:focus-visible + span {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .submit-button {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 3.25rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: white;
    cursor: pointer;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: background-color 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .submit-button:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .submit-button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .form-status {
    min-height: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .choice-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .submit-button:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
